      "runtime_contract": {
        "clip_names": "looping clips carry a \"-loop\" suffix (Godot imports them as Idle / IdleArmed / Walk / WalkArmed with loop LINEAR); look clips up by both names",
        "hover": "the Floater hovers: the ball bottom stays ~0.2 m above the walking plane in every living clip",
        "turn_to_attacker": null,
        "hit": "non-lethal: play Hit<variant> (0.3 s directional recoil, hover kept; variant from the shot direction relative to the facing, ragdoll.handoff.variant_rule); no turn",
        "death": "user decisions 2026-10-02: play Death<variant> (0.133 s snappy recoil away from the shot while the anti-grav cuts out; no turn, no crumple); on its last frame start the ragdoll with that variant's velocities (ragdoll.handoff.variants), the ground-clearance lift, the same push delta-v on EVERY body along the shot (ragdoll.handoff.extra_push.bones), the whole-body twist toward the shooter (ragdoll.handoff.twist_toward_shooter: rigid rotation of all bodies about the vertical through the mass centre, 0 for a frontal shot, full from behind) and the per-death variation; settle-and-freeze with the settle-assist, the late assist and the depenetration lift (ragdoll.settle_and_freeze); DeathBaked is the no-physics fallback (DeathFront, drops onto the ball, topples)",
        "blood": "every shot: ray-cast against the visible skinned mesh, a wound decal at the hit point on the hit bone (BoneAttachment3D, cull mask = the unit's own visual layer, capped) with drip runs growing down the surface; the decal carries a dark violet ragged entry hole (3 variants per wound, random roll per hit, wound_decals.variants); the hit spray starts AT the skin on that hole (emitter spray.runtime.origin_inset_m inside the surface, burst-origin texel on it, billboard pulled depth_pull_m toward the camera) and flies BACK toward the shooter (normalize(-shot + normal), blood.json spray.runtime); at death floor splatter decals; pool under the frozen corpse. Shots on the anti-grav machine (metal) still use the violet decal set in the lab; a spark / no-blood rule for metal hits is open for review. No UV0 wound overlay"
      },
      "albedo_policy": "natural sprite colours (FLOATER.PCK ramps, no per-asset darkening; user decision 2026-10-02: modern lighting renders units brighter than the sprites, accepted)",
      "metals_policy": "Metals rule 2026-10-02: bare metal metallic 1.0 with a reflectance-level albedo, paint metallic 0, no ambient occlusion in metal albedo (never darken metal). Ball: anodised violet-indigo #8a74b8, rough .18; tube sleeve / rod: lightly tinted steel #b4b0c8, rough .35; collar band paint #5a4a72 (metallic 0); emitter disc glossy non-metal; cloth gold piping: brass #ebcc85 metallic 1, rough .38",
      "looping_clips": [
        "Idle-loop",
        "IdleArmed-loop",
        "Walk-loop",
        "WalkArmed-loop"
      ],
